{"version":"1","id":"onmsft","handle":"onmsft","name":"OnMSFT","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/e33420e33b2b43dc8ab3a3b4598a4cb4","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-6.5191,"y":4.9184,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":63,"newest_post_at":"2022-12-16T15:17:05.000Z","oldest_post_at":"2022-03-07T14:19:56.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.02381,"listicle_ratio":0.063492,"question_ratio":0.079365,"avg_read_time":2.492063,"summary_length_avg":300.967742,"title_length_avg":70.603175,"title_length_var":535.064752,"tag_entropy":3.292139,"tag_diversity":0.857143,"top_tag_share":0.301587,"avg_upvotes":2.047619,"median_upvotes":1.0,"avg_comments":0.063492,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.038462,"zero_engagement_share":0.460317,"viral_share":0.0,"posts_per_week":1.567319,"non_article_ratio":0.0,"author_present_share":0.31746,"recency_skew":0.536585},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-0.2941,0.3235],"cadence_depth":[-2.9559,-7.1029],"hype_variety":[5.6912,1.25],"title_style":[7.9853,8.7206]},"top_tags":[["microsoft",28],["windows",25],["general-programming",7],[".net",7],["azure",6],["devtools",6],["powershell",5],["tools",4]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["Do you still need SQL in 2022?","What's new in the latest Python Extension releases for Visual Studio Code?","How to instantly install Windows Terminal, set the default terminal app, and more on Windows 11"],"outlier":["What's new with C#11"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"PcNquzzmh","title":"How to enable and install hidden education themes on Windows 11 to brighten your desktop background","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/how-to/how-to-add-education-themes-on-windows-11","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-enable-and-install-hidden-education-themes-on-windows-11-to-brighten-your-desktop-background-pcnquzzmh","summary":"Windows 11 22H2+ includes 'education themes', intended for students using school devices. If you are looking to spruce up your desktop, it's easy to enable and install these themes on any Windows 11 version. Take a look at the background images for the education themes on Windows 11 in the gallery below.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/d6b1567b8c8f883b4f1634e30fbf50ab","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-16T15:17:05.000Z"},{"id":"VUlsVeAq3","title":"Microsoft brings back Developer News extension in Visual Studio with refreshing updates","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/news/microsoft-brings-back-developer-news-in-visual-studio-with-refreshing-updates","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/microsoft-brings-back-developer-news-extension-in-visual-studio-with-refreshing-updates-vulsveaq3","summary":"Microsoft brings back Developer News extension in Visual Studio with refreshing updates. This is after discontinuing it on Visual Studio 2017, however, the company has incorporated the feature back into Visual Studio as an extension. Microsoft has gone a step further to ensure that issues encountered before will not be replicated in the new Developer News.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c69a1da99f98e840a273c1e977db9702","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-06T13:56:18.000Z"},{"id":"KToRTMRE_","title":"How to uninstall Microsoft Edge on Windows 11 and why it's probably not a good idea","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/dev/how-to-uninstall-microsoft-edge","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-uninstall-microsoft-edge-on-windows-11-and-why-it-s-probably-not-a-good-idea-ktortmre","summary":"Microsoft Edge browser on all new devices running Windows 11 this holiday season. You can uninstall Microsoft Edge on Windows 10, but it's best to leave the browser unused on your desktop instead of uninstalling it. You're better off using a different default browser on Windows, but that might not be good enough for you.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/479f957ffb6c1655a6befe075eeb2f8b","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-12-01T18:44:48.000Z"},{"id":"HDxOp9Jit","title":"How to find out which Edge browser version you have on Windows 11 right now","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/dev/find-out-microsoft-edge-browser-version","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-find-out-which-edge-browser-version-you-have-on-windows-11-right-now-hdxop9jit","summary":"You can check your Edge browser version by clicking on the Options icon (three dots) in the top-right corner of your browser. But did you know that there is an even faster way to check? Follow this guide to learn what to do.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7950b22b590f796d2b52078da275f773","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-14T17:48:13.000Z"},{"id":"IlAeVGF_h","title":"GitHub Copilot experiments with voice dictation","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/news/github-copilot-experiments-with-voice-dictation","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/github-copilot-experiments-with-voice-dictation-ilaevgf-h","summary":"Microsoft is experimenting with a new feature that will let programmers use their voices to code. The feature works just like any other voice command, such as Siri or Alexa. If you are interested in this feature, you will incur a monthly rate of $10 via Copilot.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5b7aa43fd011b457eeffd648c53972cc","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-10T15:42:26.000Z"},{"id":"Ly5mZjY32","title":"How to restore the full right-click menu from Windows 10 onto Windows 11 using a single Terminal command","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/how-to/restore-full-right-click-menu","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-restore-the-full-right-click-menu-from-windows-10-onto-windows-11-using-a-single-terminal-com-ly5mzjy32","summary":"Microsoft has made some great changes in Windows 11, but the operating system still has a long way to go before everything gets fixed. The full right-click menu that you want to access from Windows 10 is buried behind \"Show more options\" on Windows 11.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5972ef827c7b0d2f7730c935a11e73f7","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-10T15:19:31.000Z"},{"id":"e72KARAg4","title":"Every new Windows 10 and Windows 11 Update steals your bandwidth, here's how to fix it","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/how-to/how-to-fix-windows-11-updates","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/every-new-windows-10-and-windows-11-update-steals-your-bandwidth-here-s-how-to-fix-it-e72karag4","summary":"Microsoft has a setting to prioritize new Windows 10 and Windows 11 Update downloads and other processes to take bandwidth away from anything you run. If you're a Windows Pro or Enterprise administrator, there's a quick tweak you can make via Group Policy Editor to limit how much bandwidth Windows can take.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/682d56b64ac50f859eab3e3a94ed961b","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-09T18:52:06.000Z"},{"id":"AT4ArhG5G","title":".NET 7 is now available","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/news/net-7-is-now-available","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/net-7-is-now-available-at4arhg5g","summary":"Net 7 is now available for Windows, macOS, and Linux. It comes with native support for ARM64, enhanced.NET support on Linux, One BCL, and New TFMs. It can be attributed to the over 28,000 contributions made by over 8900 contributors via the development cycle.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/aa9dd7cef159e851834b689ac588519a","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2022-11-08T17:20:54.000Z"},{"id":"xhtNPHZPr","title":"What version of Windows do you have? Here's 4 easy ways to find out","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/how-to/what-version-of-windows-do-i-have","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-version-of-windows-do-you-have-here-s-4-easy-ways-to-find-out-xhtnphzpr","summary":"The fastest way to access which version of Windows you have is by using a keyboard shortcut. This guide will walk you through all four ways to do it on Windows 11 and you can also use these steps on Windows 10 too.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/80e6a240a1da58aff3f11bbed2b7b3e2","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-04T13:50:05.000Z"},{"id":"eoofPw8u2","title":"How to use the new File Locksmith utility in PowerToys on Windows 10 or Windows 11","url":"https://www.onmsft.com/how-to/how-to-use-file-locksmith-on-powertoys","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-use-the-new-file-locksmith-utility-in-powertoys-on-windows-10-or-windows-11-eoofpw8u2","summary":"The recent PowerToys Release v0.64.0 features two new utilities, File Locksmith and Hosts File Editor. The utility was first announced on Twitter by Clint Rutkas, Microsoft's Lead for Developer Experiences on Windows and PowerToy.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/42233c8db8796ec2f3539255b5784d90","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-03T17:06:26.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["hashnode","ossphs","elmah","hashnode_web3","permitio"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","hamelhusain","xai","hwchase17","sama"],"similar":[{"id":"hashnode","handle":"hashnode","name":"Hashnode","is_squad":false,"x":-6.3711,"y":4.754,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":621,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/4a287b2e7cb5499bae863f8e7137cdb4","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":6.570445,"median_upvotes":3.0,"author_present_share":0.384863,"hype_score":0.021739,"avg_read_time":5.76252,"tag_diversity":0.450886},"top_tags_preview":[["general-programming",111],["react",79],["tech-news",60]],"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[8.2059,6.0294],"cadence_depth":[9.2794,-0.2941]